 sus siervos, y se levantaron y se fueron juntos a Beerseba; y habitó Abraham en Beerseba.", "words": [[0, 193901], [2, 194009], [9, 194509], [17, 195009], [19, 195169], [23, 195329], [32, 195929], [34, 196189], [37, 196289], [48, 197089], [50, 197669], [53, 197789], [60, 198009], [67, 198549], [69, 199104], [79, 199908], [81, 200070], [88, 200650], [96, 201210], [99, 202022]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 203240, "end": 211715, "text": "Y aconteció después de estas cosas, que informaron a Abraham, diciendo: He aquí que también Milca ha parido hijos a Nacor tu hermano:", "words": [[0, 203240], [2, 203385], [12, 204065], [20, 204385], [23, 204585], [29, 204765], [36, 205185], [40, 205465], [51, 206205], [53, 206365], [62, 206845], [72, 208302], [75, 208444], [80, 208684], [84, 208864], [92, 209184], [98, 209524], [101, 209864], [108, 210224], [114, 210464], [116, 210704], [122, 210944], [125, 211184]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 212165, "end": 216853, "text": "A Huz su primogénito, y a Buz su hermano, y a Kemuel padre de Aram,", "words": [[0, 212300], [2, 212474], [6, 212647], [9, 212747], [22, 213567], [24, 213847], [26, 214127], [30, 214407], [33, 214547], [42, 214887], [44, 215227], [46, 215567], [53, 215907], [59, 216147], [62, 216407]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 217303, "end": 220913, "text": "Y a Quesed, y a Hazo, y a Pildas, y a Jidlaf, y a Betuel.", "words": [[0, 217303], [2, 217423], [4, 217793], [12, 218163], [14, 218163], [16, 218533], [22, 218903], [24, 218923], [26, 218963], [34, 219743], [36, 219743], [38, 219963], [46, 220183], [48, 220443], [50, 220483]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 221263, "end": 227377, "text": "Y Betuel engendró a Rebeca. Estos ocho parió Milca a Nacor, hermano de Abraham.", "words": [[0, 221263], [2, 221369], [9, 221729], [18, 222195], [20, 222661], [28, 223380], [34, 223750], [39, 224150], [45, 224645], [51, 225140], [53, 225635], [60, 226130], [68, 226610], [71, 226710]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 227827, "end": 234588, "text": "Y su concubina,